{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/18004-how-are-new-embeds-going-to-be-handled","id":18004,"title":"How are new Embeds going to be handled?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-25T16:25:02-08:00","id":18004,"title":"How are new Embeds going to be handled?","content":"So I'm on the Embeds section of the book and I have a question. With new products and fanmades how are new Embeds going to be handled? Will their be new types of Embeds, or are all new Embeds just placed into one of the 4 categories? Its also worth noting if they are placed in the 4 existing categories anyone that Goes Loud will have access to them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T16:31:57-08:00","id":18007,"title":"","content":"Unless some new book introduces some new Incarnation(s), then I suposse they had to be dumped in one of those 4 categories. Even if you get access to all of your Incarnation Embeds while Going Loud, you cannot use more of them in a single turn than before, so its not really a problem. It is also a very thin icing on the cake that is Going Loud.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T16:36:39-08:00","id":18011,"title":"","content":"Hmm. I'm not quite sure what reason there would be to <i>not</i> handle them in this fashion? Given that any demon can purchase any Embed at any time, and the Incarnations are pretty solid, I think the system is rather elegant. If anything, the Embed/Exploit system is one of the easiest WoD magic systems to date to arbitrarily add to, because everything is a standalone spell (Exploits do have prerequisite Embeds, but since the specific prerequisite is fluid, this doesn't actually hinder the making of new Exploits and Embeds).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/508-sikker","name":"sikker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T18:10:03-08:00","id":18060,"title":"","content":"I'm not finished with the Embed section but did I miss something saying all Embeds have to belong to an Incarnation?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T18:23:03-08:00","id":18066,"title":"","content":"Well, at the beginning of the Embeds section on page 174, under &quot;Systems&quot;, it says<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Embeds fall into one of four categories, roughly corresponding to branches of the musica universalis, also called the \u201cmusic of the spheres.\u201d </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/508-sikker","name":"sikker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-26T08:31:22-08:00","id":18421,"title":"","content":"New Embeds will fall into one of the four categories, yes. I just finished redlining that section in the Players Guide, in fact.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-27T01:33:47-08:00","id":19040,"title":"","content":"Alright official answer!<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedb